#: ../../templates.rst:227
msgid "``page``"
msgstr "``page``"

#: ../../templates.rst:228
msgid ""
"``page.meta`` contains ``date``, ``updated``, ``publish_at``, "
"``expires_at``, ``draft``, ``authors``, ``category``, ``tags``, "
"``series``, ``summary``, ``template``, ``pdf``, ``pdf_url`` and "
"``nosidebar``. Dated pages also provide ``page.word_count``, "
"``page.reading_minutes``, ``page.older``, ``page.newer`` and "
"``page.taxonomies``. Neighbors contain ``title``, ``url`` and ``date``, "
"or are ``None`` at either end. Each enabled taxonomy maps to a list of "
"``name`` and ``url`` entries."
msgstr ""
"``page.meta`` contiene ``date``, ``updated``, ``publish_at``, "
"``expires_at``, ``draft``, ``authors``, ``category``, ``tags``, "
"``series``, ``summary``, ``template``, ``pdf``, ``pdf_url`` y "
"``nosidebar``. Las páginas fechadas también proporcionan "
"``page.word_count``, ``page.reading_minutes``, ``page.older``, "
"``page.newer`` y ``page.taxonomies``. Las páginas vecinas contienen "
"``title``, ``url`` y ``date``, o son ``None`` en los extremos. Cada "
"taxonomía habilitada asocia su clave a una lista de entradas con ``name`` "
"y ``url``."

#: ../../templates.rst:229
msgid "``collection``"
msgstr "``collection``"

#: ../../templates.rst:230
msgid ""
"Generated archive pages provide ``collection.title``, "
"``collection.output``, ``collection.page`` (one-based), "
"``collection.pages``, ``collection.previous_url``, "
"``collection.next_url`` and ``collection.posts``. Each post contains "
"``title``, ``docname``, ``date``, ``url``, ``summary`` and ``meta``. "
"Previous and next URLs are relative, or ``None`` at either end. "
"Collection feeds use RSS and Atom."
msgstr ""
"Las páginas de archivo generadas proporcionan ``collection.title``, "
"``collection.output``, ``collection.page`` (empezando en 1), "
"``collection.pages``, ``collection.previous_url``, "
"``collection.next_url`` y ``collection.posts``. Cada entrada contiene "
"``title``, ``docname``, ``date``, ``url``, ``summary`` y ``meta``. Las "
"URL anterior y siguiente son relativas, o ``None`` en los extremos. Los "
"canales de colección usan RSS y Atom."

